                    subtitle:               `You are the new portfolio manager of the €2.4bn Meridiaan European Equity Fund. It trails MSCI Europe by 60 bps a year net of a 0.85% fee, a €640M pension client has issued a 90-day ultimatum for an Article 9, fossil-free strategy that also closes the gap, and your own desk is split on whether responsible money is smart money. Screen, build, and defend a portfolio that answers ter Horst’s question with evidence — not ideology.`,
