                    r4_verdict_label:       `Your verdict to the pension CIO and the board: did the responsible, active strategy add value net of fees?`,
                    verdict_evidence:       `Evidence-based — in THIS portfolio the screen earned/cost X bps and the alpha was skill not luck; here is the number`,
